# Bifur, Melodic Rider and CR 702.195c: "After a player gets an enduring story, continuous effects are reapplied before the
# game checks to see if ... preceding events have matched any trigger conditions." Bot1 controls Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl;
# Bifur entering is the third, so Bot1 has the story before Bifur's "enters or attacks" ability is looked for, and Bifur's
# "if a triggered ability of a Dwarf you control triggers, that ability triggers an additional time" applies to it (the
# rulings): two +1/+1 counters on Bifur, a 6/7. On turn nine Thraben Inspector, a Human, enters and investigates once only;
# then Bifur attacks, its ability triggers twice again, and an 8/9 Bifur hits Bot2 for 8. Bifur is the only
# creature when its ability triggers, so each triggering targets it without asking.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Bifur, Melodic Rider
Thraben Inspector
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Bifur, Melodic Rider.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T7 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.EnduringStory = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bifur, Melodic Rider.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
[T9 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Thraben Inspector.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Attack(Bifur, Melodic Rider)
[T9 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Bifur, Melodic Rider; Thraben Inspector; Clue Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Bifur, Melodic Rider.Power = 8
Bot1.Battlefield.Bifur, Melodic Rider.Toughness = 9
